# CO-QA-002 — Lender Pipeline Kanban Delete Persistence

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Effective immediately  
Authority: CO-ARCH-007 · CO-QA-001

## Rule

Kanban **Remove** must soft-delete the corresponding **EnterpriseDeal** via Deal Registry (`DELETE /api/enterprise-deals/:dealId`).

Filtering React state / rewriting `snapshot.lenders` alone is **not** a delete.

## SSOT path

`persistDealPipelineLenders` → `softDeleteRemovedPipelineDeals` → reload via `listDealsByOpportunity` (`isDeleted: false`).

## Certification

Module remains **OPEN** until `CO-QA-002-E2E-001` Passes on the live app. Build/verify/smoke do not certify.

Docs: `docs/co-qa-002/`
